    "Snap cleanly" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Se rompen limpiamente" } } } },
    "Soften and bend a stem to slow that shoot." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Suaviza y dobla un tallo para frenar ese brote." } } } },
    "Started from a seed" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Empezada desde semilla" } } } },
    "Stems bend" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Los tallos se doblan" } } } },
    "Stems crack" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Los tallos crujen" } } } },
    "Still wet — keep drying" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Aún húmedo: sigue secando" } } } },
    "Storage" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Almacenaje" } } } },
    "Stored flower is finished plant material. Keep it labeled, check it periodically, and record what you keep, use or destroy." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "La flor almacenada es material vegetal terminado. Etiquétala, revísala de vez en cuando y registra lo que guardas, consumes o destruyes." } } } },
    "Strains" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Variedades" } } } },
    "Stretching" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Estiramiento" } } } },
    "Supercropping" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Supercropping" } } } },
    "Taller and stretchier, often a longer flowering window" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Más alta y estirada, a menudo con floración más larga" } } } },
    "Tent" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Carpa" } } } },
    "This is where shape is set. Watch node spacing, keep the light schedule steady, and log feeds so you can compare cycles." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Aquí se define la forma. Vigila la distancia entre nudos, mantén el fotoperiodo estable y registra los riegos para comparar ciclos." } } } },
    "Topping" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Poda apical" } } } },
    "Unrooted cutting" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Esqueje sin enraizar" } } } },
    "Used at home by the cultivator." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Usada en casa por el cultivador." } } } },
    "Veg" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Veg" } } } },
    "Vegetative" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Vegetativo" } } } },
    "Weave a growing shoot under the net." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Teje un brote por debajo de la red." } } } },
    "Weigh wet, hang or rack the plant in a cool dark space, and keep the drying room near 18–21 °C and 58–62% humidity." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pesa en húmedo, cuelga o pon la planta en un lugar fresco y oscuro, y mantén la sala de secado cerca de 18–21 °C y 58–62% de humedad." } } } },
    "Wi-Fi" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Wi-Fi" } } } },
    "Yellowing leaves" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Hojas amarillas" } } } },
    "You rent the property you grow in" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Rentas la propiedad donde cultivas" } } } },
    "°C, grams, square metres" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "°C, gramos, metros cuadrados" } } } },
    "°F, ounces, square feet" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "°F, onzas, pies cuadrados" } } } },
    "A quick photo and a line of notes is the cheapest habit in growing. Future you will want it." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Una foto rápida y una línea de notas es el hábito más barato de cultivar. Tu yo del futuro lo agradecerá." } } } },
    "A seed, a clone or a cutting. Assign it a room and advance stages as it grows." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Una semilla, un esqueje o una estaquilla. Asígnale una sala y avanza las etapas mientras crece." } } } },
    "A tent, a closet, a whole room, a greenhouse or an outdoor plot. Each room keeps its own canopy and light schedule." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Una carpa, un armario, una sala entera, un invernadero o una parcela exterior. Cada sala mantiene su propio dosel y fotoperiodo." } } } },
    "Add a plant" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añadir una planta" } } } },
    "Add a room" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añadir una sala" } } } },
    "Add your first plant" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añade tu primera planta" } } } },
    "Add your first room" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añade tu primera sala" } } } },
    "By room" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Por sala" } } } },
    "Choose your state in the Rules tab so Grow Companion can apply the right limits." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Elige tu estado en la pestaña Normas para que Grow Companion aplique los límites correctos." } } } },
    "Clear the family filter to see the rest of this room." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Quita el filtro de familia para ver el resto de la sala." } } } },
    "Compare rooms" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Comparar salas" } } } },
    "Compliance" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cumplimiento" } } } },
