    "Started from" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Empieza desde" } } } },
    "Strain" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Variedad" } } } },
    "Taste, smell, effect, how it burned" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Sabor, olor, efecto, cómo quemó" } } } },
    "The check is removed from the scouting history." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "La inspección se elimina del historial de inspecciones." } } } },
    "The end date is calculated from the treatment date." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "La fecha final se calcula a partir de la fecha del tratamiento." } } } },
    "The record every timing metric is built on" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "El registro sobre el que se calculan todos los tiempos" } } } },
    "The record is removed from the treatment history." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "El registro se elimina del historial de tratamientos." } } } },
    "The session is removed from the plant's training history." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "La sesión se elimina del historial de entrenamiento de la planta." } } } },
    "The transition is timestamped automatically." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "La transición se registra automáticamente con fecha y hora." } } } },
    "This app never records a sale or a transfer" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Esta app nunca registra una venta ni una cesión" } } } },
    "This plant has finished its lifecycle. Its record stays for your yield history." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Esta planta terminó su ciclo. Su registro se conserva para tu historial de rendimiento." } } } },
    "This plant's harvest record" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "El registro de cosecha de esta planta" } } } },
    "Top, tie down or defoliate a plant, and the session lands here with its date and how long ago it happened." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Poda, ata o defolia una planta y la sesión aparecerá aquí con su fecha y cuánto tiempo ha pasado." } } } },
    "Training" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Entrenamiento" } } } },
    "Treatments" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Tratamientos" } } } },
    "Weigh the plant, predict the dry weight from your own harvests, and start the drying log." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pesa la planta, predice el peso seco a partir de tus propias cosechas y empieza el registro de secado." } } } },
    "What happened" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Qué pasó" } } } },
