    "Photos" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Fotos" } } } },
    "Pick a second cycle" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Elige un segundo ciclo" } } } },
    "Predicted dry weight" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Peso seco previsto" } } } },
    "Record the actual dry weight and move the plant to storage. You can change the weight later from the plant." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Registra el peso seco real y pasa la planta a almacenaje. Puedes cambiar el peso después desde la planta." } } } },
    "Save check" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Guardar control" } } } },
    "Select one more photo to compare." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Selecciona una foto más para comparar." } } } },
    "Select two photos below." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Selecciona dos fotos abajo." } } } },
    "Show everything" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mostrar todo" } } } },
    "Start curing" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Empezar curado" } } } },
    "Stem snap" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cruce del tallo" } } } },
    "Swap the two cycles" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Intercambiar los dos ciclos" } } } },
    "Temperature (°C)" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Temperatura (°C)" } } } },
    "The schedule is guidance, not a rule. Adjust it to how the jars look and smell." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "La pauta es una guía, no una regla. Ajústala a cómo se ven y huelen los frascos." } } } },
    "This timeline reads existing records only. It adds no inference, score or suggested action." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Esta línea de tiempo solo lee los registros existentes. No añade inferencias, puntuaciones ni acciones sugeridas." } } } },
    "Two harvests, one honest look" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Dos cosechas, una mirada honesta" } } } },
    "Weigh the plant, then start a drying and curing log. The predicted dry weight uses your own harvests once you have them." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Pesa la planta y empieza un registro de secado y curado. El peso seco previsto usa tus propias cosechas cuando las tengas." } } } },
    "Wet weight" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Peso húmedo" } } } },
    "What you said" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Lo que dijiste" } } } },
    "Windows come from your own flowering times where you have them" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Las ventanas salen de tus propios tiempos de floración cuando los tienes" } } } },
    "A clear look at recorded care and tasks still unfinished." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Una mirada clara a los cuidados registrados y a las tareas aún pendientes." } } } },
    "A copy you keep" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Una copia que conservas" } } } },
    "A disconnected or unavailable sensor never blocks a manual room reading." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Un sensor desconectado o no disponible nunca bloquea una lectura manual de la sala." } } } },
    "A printable summary" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Un resumen imprimible" } } } },
    "About" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Acerca de" } } } },
    "Add a room before enabling a digest." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añade una sala antes de activar el resumen." } } } },
    "Alerts" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Alertas" } } } },
    "App lock" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Bloqueo de la app" } } } },
    "Applies to every weight and area in the app" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Se aplica a cada peso y área de la app" } } } },
