    "Enable notifications" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Activar notificaciones" } } } },
    "Encrypts the archive with AES-256 and a password you choose" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cifra el archivo con AES-256 y una contraseña que eliges" } } } },
    "Erase everything" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Borrar todo" } } } },
    "Export" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Exportar" } } } },
    "Export and delete" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Exportar y eliminar" } } } },
    "Export cultivation records" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Exportar los registros de cultivo" } } } },
    "From" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Desde" } } } },
    "Full-size images, without any location data" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Imágenes a tamaño completo, sin datos de ubicación" } } } },
    "Generic notification text" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Texto genérico de notificación" } } } },
    "Give one person a scoped, read-only view. Files are encrypted on this device and handed over by you." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Da a una persona una vista limitada y de solo lectura. Los archivos se cifran en este dispositivo y los entregas tú." } } } },
    "Grace period" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Periodo de gracia" } } } },
    "Grow Companion always tracks the exact limit. This only decides how early the warning appears." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Grow Companion siempre sigue el límite exacto. Esto solo decide con cuánta antelación aparece el aviso." } } } },
    "Grow report" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Informe de cultivo" } } } },
    "Home Screen widget" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Widget de la pantalla de inicio" } } } },
    "How it behaves" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cómo se comporta" } } } },
    "How long the app may be away before it asks again" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cuánto tiempo puede estar la app fuera antes de volver a pedirlo" } } } },
    "If notifications stay off, allow them for Grow Companion in iOS Settings." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Si las notificaciones siguen desactivadas, permítelas para Grow Companion en Ajustes de iOS." } } } },
    "Include journal photos" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Incluir las fotos del diario" } } } },
    "Include photos from your journal" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Incluir las fotos de tu diario" } } } },
    "It is not used to send anything today: there is no account, no server and no recipient." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Hoy no se usa para enviar nada: no hay cuenta, ni servidor, ni destinatario." } } } },
    "Journal photos" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Fotos del diario" } } } },
    "Keep a protected copy of your grow record." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Conserva una copia protegida de tu registro de cultivo." } } } },
    "Keep connected" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mantener conectado" } } } },
    "Keep my data" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Conservar mis datos" } } } },
    "Keep share" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Conservar el uso compartido" } } } },
